@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam margin 12
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
top to bottom direction

[Camera\nCampus field] as Cam
[ESP32-S3 Wearables\nCampus field] as Esp
[Vision and Sensor Processes\nProject PC] as Proc
[Local Session Files\nProject PC] as Files
[FastAPI\nProject PC] as API
[Local Coaching Dashboard\nProject PC] as LocalUI
[Cloudflare DNS and HTTPS Proxy] as CF
[Caddy\nVPS] as Caddy
[CPG44 Relay\nVPS, 4 MiB memory cache\nno match storage] as Relay

Cam --> Proc : local video
Esp --> CF : HTTPS raw sensor batches
CF --> Caddy : cpg44.nivaspms.com
Caddy --> Relay : loopback route
Relay --> Proc : authenticated WSS\nlive and replay
Proc --> Files : session evidence
Proc --> API : live and review data
API --> LocalUI : local WebSocket
footer <color:white>.</color>
@enduml
